  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cximTtw.png\" width=\"491\" height=\"258\"></p>\n<p>Much More Dungeons 為 Minecraft 1.20.1 添加了手工製作的地牢內容，支援 Fabric 和 Forge 平台。當前版本專注於一座融入主世界景觀的表面塔樓地牢，通過探索獎勵玩家實用的一到中後期戰利品。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"Brand Assets\" width=\"318\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\"></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>為世界生成新增塔樓地牢結構</li>\n<li>支援 Minecraft 1.20.1 的 Fabric 和 Forge 平台</li>\n<li>使用手工製作的 NBT 結構數據，確保地牢佈局一致</li>\n<li>自然生成於平原、森林、針葉林、白樺林和黑森林生物羣系</li>\n<li>採用隨機散佈放置機制，以平衡探索與發現體驗</li>\n<li>整合 Minecraft 的拼圖（jigsaw）世界生成系統，實現穩定的結構放置</li>\n<li>包含精心調校的箱子戰利品，注重實用進展而非過度強大的獎勵</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>塔樓地牢亮點</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>具有地形感知放置功能的表面結構</li>\n<li>設計為可發現的主世界地標</li>\n<li>適合冒險、探索和生存進展</li>\n<li>戰利品可能包括鐵、金、綠寶石、鑽石、紅石、食物、金蘋果和附魔書</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>戰利品風格</strong></h2>\n<p>塔樓地牢的箱子設計旨在提供滿足感，同時不跳過遊戲進展。戰利品池包括生存所需的常見物資、提升勢頭的中階貴重物品，以及稀有物品的少量機率掉落，帶來難忘的發現體驗。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3DYM4jV.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GoWh5QE.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ujTrbXc.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FFeQjkB.png\"></p>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minecraft 1.20.1 - 26.1</li>\n<li>Fabric</li>\n<li>Forge</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<h2>支持與鏈接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Discord:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK</a></li>\n<li>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MeherBenSalem</a></li>\n<li>CurseForge: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects</a></li>\n<li>Modrinth: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>",
